# Build context for deploy/linux/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads this file instead
# of the root .dockerignore): the workspace manifests, crates/, skill/ and
# the server tarball's two files in deploy/server/, nothing else.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!skill/
!deploy/server/klav-server.service
!deploy/server/server.toml.example
crates/**/target/
